    "min": 60,
    "max": 120
   },
   "faq": "Timing rest is optional; the priority is feeling recovered without letting the session drag."
  },
  "supersets": "Exercises with the same prefix (S1, S2, S3…) are a superset: one set of the first, then one set of the second, then rest the listed time (listed on the second exercise) and repeat.",
  "substitutions": "Every exercise lists two alternatives with a very similar training effect. Prefer the main exercise if you can; swap for equipment or preference.",
  "exercise_order": "Small reorders are fine when the gym is crowded; avoid scrambling the workout.",
  "looping": "After week 12, loop back to week 1.",
  "four_day_option": "Run the workouts in order and carry the remaining workout(s) into the next week."
